     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I believe you do it via guide_legend(label.vjust = ___).</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://docs.ggplot2.org/current/guide_legend.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.ggplot2.org/current/guide_legend.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467244702000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lGtHHdGytHwpDmmo4k0T_\">http://docs.ggplot2.org/current/guide_legend.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>Not 100% sure though - if it is a one time deal, you can also re-position elements in a pdf with Acrobat Pro or Inkscape. </div><div><br></div><div>Matt  </div></div>"
    ],
